OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary instructs officials
OL,4,Ato consider budget 'contingency plans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state has said he has
OL,7,Finstructed officials to consider
OL,8,F"contingency plans" around a budget for
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland, in the ongoing
OL,10,Fabsence of agreement from the executive
OL,11,Fon a funding offer.
OL,13,FLast week, Sir Chris Bryant said the
OL,14,Fdeal of #1.5bn over three years was the
OL,15,F"final offer" and had given parties a
OL,16,Fdeadline of Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41702
