OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANI secretary instructs officials
OL,4,Ato consider budget 'contingency plans'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont Finance Minister John O'Dowd
OL,7,Fand Ulster Unionist Party (UUP) leader
OL,8,FJon Burrows had asked the government to
OL,9,Fpush back the deadline, in light of
OL,10,Fpolitical uncertainty over the Drumcree
OL,11,Fdispute.
OL,13,FIn a letter seen by BBC News NI, Sir
OL,14,FChris said he appreciated the effect
OL,15,Frecent events have had on executive
OL,16,Fparties.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
